    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luny bumä Kuɔth luaak Kuɔth",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ram indaan ɣä naŋ kɛ thok kal in lot ni kui̱c känyä ca̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn wani, cu buay Kuɔth I-thɛ-rɛl ben kui̱c känyä ca̱ŋ. Kä ce̱t jɔwdɛ kɛ jɔw pi̱i̱ni ti ŋuan. Kä cuɛ piny riaw kɛ buaydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn nyuuth in cä nɛn ce̱tdɛ kɛ nyuuth ëë nɛ̈ɛ̈nä mëë bä Kuoth wec ben däk, kɛnɛ nyuuth ëë cä kɔŋ nɛn mëë ta̱a̱ jɔk kiɛɛr Kɛ-bar, mëë cua̱ rɔ yuɔr piny ni buupä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu buay Kuɔth Nhial coth rɛy luaak Kuɔth kɛ thok in lot ni käny ca̱ŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cu yiëë ɣä kap nhial kä cuɛ ɣä nööŋ ni rɛy kal in te rɛci. Kä cu buay Kuɔth Nhial luaak Kuɔth thiäŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min te wut ɛmɔ cuŋä gekädä, cua̱ ram mi ruac kɛ ɣä liŋ, ruac ɛ kɛ ɣä rɛy luaak Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ɣä jiök i̱, “Gat ran, mɛmɛ ɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th kɔamdä, kä gua̱a̱th ciöknikä min bä cieŋ thi̱n, rɛy ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl amäni cäŋ kɛl. Kä /ci thok duëël I-thɛ-rɛl ciötdä min rɛl rɔ bi nyɔk kɛ yäri, kä /ci kua̱rkiɛn ɛ bi ya̱r kɛ lät leerädiɛn kɛ pua̱ny kua̱rikiɛn gua̱th palikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ tuut lueeknikiɛn thiëëk kɛ tuut luaakdä, kä cikɛ wääthni ciëëŋnikiɛn thiëëk kɛ wääthni luaakdä, a te ni päny kamädä kɛ kɛ, kɛn la yär kɛn ni ciötdä min rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ kɛ lätkiɛn ti jiäk tin cikɛn kɛ la̱t. Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, ɣän cua̱ kɛ näk kɛ ŋɛ̈ɛ̈nydä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ akɛ wuɔckɛ ciaŋ kuthni guääynikiɛn, kä a ri̱ŋ kua̱rikiɛn nɔ̱a̱n kɛ ɣä, ɣän bä cieŋ rɛydiɛn amäni cäŋ kɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä kɛ kui̱du lö gat ran lärni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ta̱a̱ luaak Kuɔth kä akɛ thɛ̈mkɛ ta̱a̱dɛ, kä akɛ po̱c kɛ dueerkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wä kɛ wä pöc kɛ tin diaal tin cikɛn kɛ la̱t, ku kɛ jakä ŋa̱ckɛ ta̱a̱ in bi tekɛ luaak Kuɔth, rialidɛ ikä, kɛnɛ duɔ̱p tin wä kɛ naath raar kɛnɛ duɔ̱p tin wä kɛ naath rɛc, kɛ jɛn ta̱a̱ in bi tekɛ luaak Kuɔth ni kɛɛliw. Kä lär ni naath ta̱a̱ ŋuɔ̱tnikɛ diaal kɛnɛ luëëkɛ diaal, gɔ̱rnikɛ piny nhiamdiɛn, kɛ ɣöö dee kɛn ta̱a̱dɛ tit kä guurkɛn ŋuɔ̱tkɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mɛmɛ ɛ jɛn ŋut kɛ kui̱ luaak Kuɔth, ɛn gua̱a̱th ɛ thieek kɛ wi̱c pa̱a̱mɛ ni kɛɛliw, bɛ a gua̱a̱th mi rɛl gɔɔydɛ rɔ. Mɛmɛ ɛ jɛn ŋut kɛ kui̱ luaak Kuɔth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yi̱k",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn theemni yi̱kä tin ca thɛm kɛ jua̱th tetni (kä jɛn juäth tetdä, ɛ juäth tetdä mi tekɛ pät tetdä) bi pinydɛ tekɛ juäth tetdä bär jiɛcdɛ, kä ɣäp ɣääpdɛ ɛ juäth tetdä, kä bi gëëkɛ win kɛ thɛɛr kɛl. Ɛn nɔmɔ bɛ la jɛn bär yi̱kä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A känɛ jɛ ni piny ni wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n a wä ni thɛɛrädɛ, ɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ rɛw, kä ɣäp ɣääpdɛ ɛ juäth tetdä kɛl. Kä a känɛ jɛ ni thɛɛrä min tɔt a wä thɛɛrä min di̱i̱t, ɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ ŋuaan, kä ɣäp ɣääpdɛ ɛ juäth tetdä kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä wi̱c yi̱kä min waŋkɛ muc thi̱n, ɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ ŋuaan. Kä wi̱c yi̱kä min waŋkɛ muc thi̱n ca lät kä tuɔ̱ŋ da̱ŋ ŋuaan ti wä nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä wi̱c yi̱kä min waŋkɛ muc thi̱n ɛ pur pur, tëë kɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ wäl rɛw bärɛ kɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ wäl rɛw ɣäp ɣääpdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi thɛɛr yi̱kä a mi pur pur, bi bärɛ a jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ wäl ŋuaan, kä bi ɣäp ɣääpdɛ a jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ wäl ŋuaan, kɛ thɛɛr mi wil jɛ, mi ɣäp ɣääpdɛ ɛ nuth jua̱a̱th tetdä. Kä bi gua̱a̱th in wil jɛ juäth tetdä kɛl. Kä bi ko̱o̱tnikɛ lot ni pek känyä ca̱ŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lëy yi̱kä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruac kɛ ɣä laarɛ jɛ, ɛn ɣöö mɛmɛ ɛ ruac Kua̱r ni Kuoth Nhial wëë i̱, “Ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn ŋut kɛ kui̱ yi̱kä, kɛ cäŋ in ba jɛ la̱t kä ba loori kɛnɛ muc tin waŋkɛ kɛ riɛm in kiɛthkɛ wi̱i̱dɛ wä tok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bia bööth palä tin la ji̱ thuɔk duëël Dha-dok tin la bä nhiamdä, kä la̱tkɛ ɣä ikä ka̱m thäk, kɛ kui̱ mucä dueeri ruac ni ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱n bi tha̱a̱ŋ riɛmdɛ ka̱n kä bi jɛ la̱th tuɔ̱ŋni yi̱kä da̱ŋ ŋuaan kɛnɛ gɔŋtɔtnikɛ da̱ŋ ŋuaan, kɛ thɛɛrɛ kɛɛliw. Kä bi jɛ cu lɛy inɔ, kä bi jɛ cu luɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱n bä käni thäk mucä kɛ kui̱ dui̱rä, kä ba jɛ waŋ ni guäth in ca mɛk guäth luaak Kuɔth, raar gua̱th in rɛl rɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
